        <briefdescription>
<para>Start a client to a remote master using a background fiber. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If recovery is finalized (i.e. r-&gt;writer != NULL) then the client connect to a master and follow remote updates using SUBSCRIBE command.</para><para>If recovery is not finalized (i.e. r-&gt;writer == NULL) then the client connects to a master, downloads and processes a checkpoint using JOIN command and then switches to &apos;follow&apos; mode.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para>fiber_start() </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
